    "description": {
      "value": "<ul>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> <strong>Mysticism/Mysticism: Burst Class Feature</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can draw the most out of your spells.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <em>Static Bonus</em> to <strong>Spells</strong></li>\n<li>Choose 1 <em>School of Magic</em>; while in this <strong>Stance</strong> the base range of all <strong>Spells</strong> of this school with a range greater than self or touch by 50%, this can not be changed later.</li>\n<li>You get 1 <em>Metamagic Option</em> of your choice, that cannot be changed later, that you may only use while in this <strong>Stance.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n",
